Yabomish asset attributions
===========================

App icons (icon.icns, AppIcon.icns, icon_dev.icns, AppIconDev.icns)
  Based on the Twemoji "fried shrimp" emoji (🍤), mirrored and adapted
  (ink-tone background, silhouette separation cuts, corner badges).
  Twemoji graphics: Copyright 2020 Twitter, Inc and other contributors.
  License: CC-BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Source: https://github.com/twitter/twemoji

Menu-bar / input-source icons (icon.tiff, icon_dev.tiff, icon_en.tiff)
  Generated at build time by tools/make_icons.swift (badge glyphs
  蝦 / β / A). Original project artwork, no third-party assets.

Vector source files for these assets live in assets/.
